###회원가입
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loginId": "flutteruser1",
  "password": "1234"
}

###로그인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loginId": "flutteruser1",
  "password": "1234"
}

### 채팅방 생성
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerId": 1,
  "title": "Flutter 테스트 방",
  "durationMinutes": 60
}

### 보안 코드로 입장
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/join-by-code
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inviteCode": "SN4VK6I3",
  "userId": 2
}

### roomId로 채팅방 참가
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2
}
